From: Codex <codex@openai.com>
Subject: [PATCH] avoid blocking BZI6 KG30 lookup on M4 G965F

# Reason: M4 first-boot ANR evidence places SystemServer in KnoxGuard30's
# synchronous TA-state query. The pinned G965F vendor stack has no KG30 AIDL
# provider, while donor getService() waits for registration. Use the existing
# nonblocking ServiceManager lookup so the existing fail-closed 0xff02 response
# returns promptly; preserve binder validation, state mapping and bounded retry.
# Affected: M4 finalization services.jar helper/lock, hook and compiled image
# verifier metadata/check. No generated Apktool tree, state value, vendor, radio,
# kernel, EFS or bootloader content is changed.
# Verify: exact BZI6 donor/class locks; source apply/idempotence and wrong-source/
# scope rejection; Apktool assemble/decode; compiled checkService/no-wait check;
# ext4 byte, mode, owner and SELinux gates. Runtime cold boot remains pending.
# Rollback: remove 0217 from series/source lock and rebuild from BZI6 donor; keep
# the existing M4-0217 package as rollback until the new candidate passes.

--- a/rom/unica/patches/exynos9810_device_stack/exynos9810_finalization/customize.sh
+++ b/rom/unica/patches/exynos9810_device_stack/exynos9810_finalization/customize.sh
@@ -7537,6 +7537,26 @@
